                                "sense_id": "c990c774-d4e0-3cbb-8c9b-2c9dcbe47a09",
                                "text": "Do you think it was a ladyish, afternoon call, another-cup-of-tea-please apparition that visits your Professor Cranks and that journalist chap you are always talking about?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8afade43-fd39-4f8d-8d52-c3a7771b9f24",
                                "sense_id": "c990c774-d4e0-3cbb-8c9b-2c9dcbe47a09",
                                "text": "She is an innocent young thing, after all--younger than I ever was--for all her fine dresses and her grand ladyish way."
